#version 450

// AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0, EASU (edge-adaptive spatial
// upsampling): a GLSL port of FsrEasuF from ffx_fsr1.h. The CPU reference
// (easuReconstruct in src/engine/graphics/SpatialUpscale.cpp) mirrors this
// shader; keep them in sync.
//
// Differences from the reference implementation: the 12 taps are fetched
// individually and clamped to the input viewport, because dynamic resolution
// renders into the top-left region of a larger image whose other texels are
// stale; and flat-region reciprocals are clamped instead of relying on the
// approximate reciprocal of zero being finite.
